{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/b42f14effd054f74f205628b4a4a6310.avif?t=1770862705\" width=1560 height=3604 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Card-Based Roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everwayne combines a card-based roguelike, party hero selection, and metroidvania elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your tavern, explore the world, and create powerful combinations of hero abilities, cards, relics, and artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f9eea107938e2e5fb9a9de8152c45b4b.poster.avif?t=1770862705\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f9eea107938e2e5fb9a9de8152c45b4b.webm?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/f9eea107938e2e5fb9a9de8152c45b4b.mp4?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Play as one or several heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Tactical positioning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Character synergies for advanced strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Challenging bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Tavern management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 A detailed, hand-drawn world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Engaging story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Dangerous dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 Interactive, immersive environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 A unique encounter system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.poster.avif?t=1770862705\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.webm?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.mp4?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the Gameplay and the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is beautifully hand-drawn and filled with interactive elements and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you travel across its lands, you\u2019ll discover mysterious locations, dungeons, and story quests that deepen your understanding of the game\u2019s rich world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We\u2019ve put a lot of effort into bringing this world to life and making it feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combination of gameplay mechanics, worldbuilding, and story creates a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: ce