gn: center\">\u2022 Interactive, immersive environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2022 A unique encounter system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.poster.avif?t=1770862705\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.webm?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/00bb5eff986ccc8d218600b1e41dfbe8.mp4?t=1770862705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>About the Gameplay and the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is beautifully hand-drawn and filled with interactive elements and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you travel across its lands, you\u2019ll discover mysterious locations, dungeons, and story quests that deepen your understanding of the game\u2019s rich world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">We\u2019ve put a lot of effort into bringing this world to life and making it feel alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The combination of gameplay mechanics, worldbuilding, and story creates a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your adventure awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498600/extras/7a7c1b02226e48a114c43612cf8fd1